# ============================================================================
# Signing material — NEVER commit
#
# _preserved_2026-08-04/android/app/tradiemate-release.keystore is the live
# Play upload key. Its SHA-256 matches upload_certificate.pem exactly
# (B8:A7:E7:3F:...:14:B8), so it is the only key Play will accept for an update
# to com.tradiemate.app. If it leaks, anyone can sign an upload as you; if it is
# lost, this listing can never be updated again. Keep it backed up outside the
# repo, in a password manager or secrets vault.
# ============================================================================
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx

